    {"_sprozz_thief_", "@The_monster@ shouts, \"Patent thief! You won\\'t get away with this!\"", "speech.monspeak.055a2ea22cf25480"},
    {"_sprozz_thief_", "@The_monster@ yells, \"I thought of it first! Give it back!\"", "speech.monspeak.a037a8d13f516499"},
    {"_sprozz_thief_", "@The_monster@ grumbles, \"I\\'ll bet your bee is still using copper gearwork!\"", "speech.monspeak.7ddf3022a273527c"},
    {"_sprozz_thief_", "@The_monster@ shouts, \"Who\\'s been selling my blueprints\? Tell me!\"", "speech.monspeak.1197fd4f1000268b"},
    {"_sprozz_common_", "@The_monster@ says, \"Allow me to demonstrate the bee of the future!\"", "speech.monspeak.44932f7faadae357"},
    {"_sprozz_common_", "@The_monster@ says, \"It makes honey *and* kills pests. Ingenious!\"", "speech.monspeak.ef7024d948d31494"},
    {"_sprozz_common_", "@The_monster@ says, \"Clockwork honey contains at least 35% more iron! Nutritious.\"", "speech.monspeak.d18d57f18255375f"},
    {"_sprozz_common_", "@The_monster@ says, \"Chitin is about to be a thing of the past!\"", "speech.monspeak.89eb925716a0a825"},
    {"_sprozz_common_", "@The_monster@ grins. \"Soon, every apiary\\'s gonna want a piece of Sprozz!\"", "speech.monspeak.1702e44ccdecf291"},
    {"_sprozz_common_", "@The_monster@ says, \"I need a test subject for my new stingers. I volunteer you.\"", "speech.monspeak.132b651668b27e70"},
    {"_sprozz_common_", "@The_monster@ says, \"Tell me how much this hurts, okay\? I need more data.\"", "speech.monspeak.7bcdb8d6b1890457"},
    {"_sprozz_common_", "@The_monster@ mumbles, \"Perhaps it could use a bit more zinc in the wings....\"", "speech.monspeak.45696a9a6942ca1c"},
    {"_sprozz_common_", "@The_monster@ mutters, \"Next time I\\'m using spur gears. Less buzzing.\"", "speech.monspeak.c5b815e6c30fb24c"},
    {"_sprozz_common_", "@The_monster@ mumbles, \"Pollen collection still 41% less efficient. Must improve.\"", "speech.monspeak.8dc393a93fdc089c"},
    {"_sprozz_common_", "@The_monster@ mumbles, \"Nectar collection still 37% less efficient. Must improve.\"", "speech.monspeak.5d7de391d8769080"},
    {"_terence_common_", "VISUAL:@The_monster@ looks scornfully at @foe@.", "speech.monspeak.ed4749d3a765dbe0"},
    {"_terence_common_", "VISUAL:@The_monster@ bares @possessive@ teeth.", "speech.monspeak.8fe924988d97e8ac"},
    {"_terence_common_", "VISUAL:@The_monster@ looks irritated.", "speech.monspeak.dcd87e43d0d23350"},
    {"_terence_common_", "@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"I fought strong elephant-riders! You're not strong!\"", "speech.monspeak.cba8fad78cc8973b"},
    {"_terence_common_", "@The_monster@ looks @foe@ up and down. \"You're not a real warrior! I'll show you a warrior!\"", "speech.monspeak.edd7e2878f83fc4f"},
    {"_terence_common_", "@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I've sent legions of armataurs to their deaths. With their elephants.\"", "speech.monspeak.5fe51874b570ddba"},
    {"_terence_common_", "@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"I hate armataurs! They have no honour!\"", "speech.monspeak.d1ffe3ddafbf5d4e"},
    {"_terence_common_", "@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I retired to this dungeon. Do you want to retire to the afterlife\?\"", "speech.monspeak.eb04b2f2e8e37fb9"},
    {"_terence_common_", "@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"I'm retired! Go away!\"", "speech.monspeak.29dd5559f2633e71"},
    {"_terence_common_", "@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"I want to be left alone!\"", "speech.monspeak.73eb63f20a1859c9"},
    {"_terence_rare_", "@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Stand, coward! You want a fight, show some honour!\"", "speech.monspeak.800cf09245e989df"},
    {"_terence_rare_", "@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I'm tired of war. But if you want blood, you'll get blood!\"", "speech.monspeak.8331d73915f014e4"},
    {"_terence_rare_", "@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Get out, before I make you get out!\"", "speech.monspeak.0e2056b650d5f267"},
    {"_terence_rare_", "@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"I hate trespassers!\"", "speech.monspeak.77e5dc6b2d5ea69f"},
    {"_terence_rare_", "@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"I put up a 'Do Not Disturb' sign! Can't you read\?!\"", "speech.monspeak.9639026d5143dda5"},
    {"terence triumphant", "@The_monster@ says, \"Finally, peace and quiet.\"", "speech.monspeak.77df179a6d2ee176"},
    {"terence triumphant", "@The_monster@ says, \"And stay out!\"", "speech.monspeak.c4541f91e765a8b1"},
    {"terence triumphant", "@The_monster@ says, \"Win and live. Lose and die. It's the rule of life.\"", "speech.monspeak.3c7c794efff7f343"},
    {"terence triumphant", "@The_monster@ says, \"Honour does not prevent me from taking a tactical advantage.\"", "speech.monspeak.3990d747c82ce6e5"},
    {"_urug_common_", "@_generic_orc_speech_@", "speech.monspeak.bcfb6c84c7b48d7c"},
